    <briefdescription>
<para>Utility functions for the µTest++ testing framework. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1utility" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus::utility</ref></computeroutput> namespace provides a suite of helper functions for the strings that the tests often check.</para>
<para>These utilities include functions for extracting the file name from a path, for pattern matching (verifying whether a string matches a pattern with <computeroutput>*</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>?</computeroutput> wildcards), and for splitting strings into sub-strings based on delimiters. </para>
